{%- comment -%}
  SYNOR DIARIES — paana na photo.

  Dukaan ma dar product na paanch photo pehle thi padya chhe. Blog ek pan
  nahoto vaaprato, etle paanu fakt lakhan nu lagtu hatu. Ahiya e jodaay chhe,
  ane jodaay chhe aapoaap: post na `pick-<handle>` tag j kahe chhe ke kaya
  product chhe, etle lakhnaar ne koi photo upload karvano j nathi.

  Traan jagya:
    1. PLATE — upar, jyare hero photo ke video na hoy. "Aa char, jem testaya."
       Chhapa ma pan pehla paana par photo ni patti aavi j rite aave chhe.
    2. SHOT  — lakhan ni andar, dar <h2> pachhi je product nu naam dharave.
       Aa j asli kaam chhe: lakhan no divaal tute chhe tyaan j jyaan tutvo
       joiye. Ene JS jode chhe, karan ke body HTML lakhnaar likhe chhe ane
       Liquid ene chirfaadi na sake.
    3. THUMB — niche na classified ad ma, nanu.
    4. DRAWN — make_images.py e dorela chitro, je jagya na chhe. Dareek
       niche "chitra" lakhelu chhe.

  Photo Shopify mathi live aave chhe, body ma URL chhapati nathi — product no
  photo badlaay to blog ma pan badlaay jaay chhe.

  Dukaan na photo chorasa chhe (1254x1254), etle kyay crop nathi karyu.
  Andar no photo 250px no chorasa chhe — aakhi botal dekhaay, ane lakhan
  ni vachche moto khado pan na pade.

  Vaapar: {%- render 'sa-blog-pics', picks: picks, s: s, sid: sid -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign shown = 0
  capture rows
    for h in picks limit: 6
      assign p = all_products[h]
      if p != blank and p.featured_image != blank
        assign shown = shown | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  endcapture
-%}

{%- if shown > 0 -%}
  {%- if s.show_plate -%}
    <figure class="nd-plate" data-count="{{ shown }}">
      <div class="nd-plate-in">
        {%- for h in picks limit: 6 -%}
          {%- assign p = all_products[h] -%}
          {%- if p != blank and p.featured_image != blank -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign sw = 'default'
              for t in p.tags
                assign low = t | downcase
                if low contains 'family-'
                  if low contains 'fresh' or low contains 'aquatic'
                    assign sw = 'fresh'
                  elsif low contains 'floral' or low contains 'fruity'
                    assign sw = 'floral'
                  elsif low contains 'woody' or low contains 'oud'
                    assign sw = 'woody'
                  elsif low contains 'amber' or low contains 'sweet'
                    assign sw = 'amber'
                  endif
                  break
                endif
              endfor
            -%}
            <a href="{{ p.url }}" data-fam="{{ sw }}">
              {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 420 | image_tag:
                   widths: '150,220,300,420', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 180px, 34vw',
                   loading: 'lazy', alt: p.title | escape }}
              <s>{{ p.title | remove_first: 'SYNOR ' }}</s>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      {%- if s.plate_note != blank -%}
        <figcaption>{{ s.plate_note }}</figcaption>
      {%- endif -%}
    </figure>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Lakhan ni andar na photo mate ni yaadi. JS aane vaanche chhe ane dar
    <h2> ne ena naam thi match kare chhe.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if s.show_shots -%}
    <script type="application/json" id="nd-pics-{{ sid }}">
      [
        {%- assign first = true -%}
        {%- for h in picks limit: 6 -%}
          {%- assign p = all_products[h] -%}
          {%- if p != blank and p.featured_image != blank -%}
            {%- unless first %},{% endunless -%}
            {%- assign first = false -%}
            {
              "name": {{ p.title | json }},
              "short": {{ p.title | remove_first: 'SYNOR ' | json }},
              "url": {{ p.url | json }},
              "img": {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 | json }},
              "alt": {{ p.title | json }}
            }
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ]
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Chitro — je make_images.py e dorya ane Shopify Files ma chadavya.
  Product na photo alag chhe; aa jagya na chhe. Dareek niche "chitra" lakhelu
  chhe, ane e jaani joine chhe: aakha kaagaj no daavo e chhe ke koi kharekhar
  jaine test karyu hatu, ane e daavo tyare j tike chhe jyare chitra ne chitra
  kahevaay. Chhapa pan sadio thi e j kare chhe.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign drawn = article.metafields.custom.shots.value -%}
{%- if drawn != blank -%}
  <script type="application/json" id="nd-drawn-{{ sid }}">{{ drawn }}</script>
{%- endif -%}

<style>
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate{margin:16px {{ s.gutter }}px 0;
  width:calc(100% - {{ s.gutter | times: 2 }}px);border:2px solid {{ s.ink }};
  background:{{ s.white }};padding:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate-in{display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(88px,1fr));gap:1px;
  background:{{ s.rule }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate a{display:block;background:{{ s.white }};
  padding:9px 7px 8px;text-decoration:none;color:{{ s.ink }};position:relative}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate a::before{content:'';position:absolute;
  left:7px;top:7px;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--c,{{ s.gold }});z-index:1}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate a[data-fam="fresh"]{--c:{{ s.c_fresh }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate a[data-fam="floral"]{--c:{{ s.c_floral }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate a[data-fam="woody"]{--c:{{ s.c_woody }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate a[data-fam="amber"]{--c:{{ s.c_amber }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;
  aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate s{display:block;text-decoration:none;
  font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:{{ s.ink2 }};margin-top:6px;line-height:1.35;text-align:center}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate figcaption{font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;
  letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.soft }};
  border-top:1px solid {{ s.rule }};padding:7px 9px;text-align:center}

/* lakhan ni andar no photo */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-shot{margin:0 auto 1.2em;border:2px solid {{ s.ink }};
  background:{{ s.white }};display:block;max-width:250px}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-shot img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;
  aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:contain}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-shot figcaption{font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;
  letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.soft }};
  border-top:1px solid {{ s.rule }};padding:6px 9px;display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:center}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-shot a{color:{{ s.ink }};text-decoration:none;
  border-bottom:1px solid {{ s.ink }};white-space:nowrap}

/* doryu chitra — lakhan ni pahoLai jetlu, karan ke aa jagya no photo chhe,
   botal no nahi */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-drawn{margin:0 0 1.3em;border:2px solid {{ s.ink }};
  background:{{ s.white }};display:block}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-drawn img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;
  aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-drawn figcaption{font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;
  letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.soft }};
  border-top:1px solid {{ s.rule }};padding:6px 9px;display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-drawn em{font-style:normal;flex:none;
  color:{{ s.ink2 }};letter-spacing:.22em;opacity:.75}

/* classified ad no nano photo */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nad-im{width:46px;height:46px;flex:none;display:block;
  border:1px solid {{ s.rule }};background:{{ s.white }};position:relative}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nad-im img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;
  display:block}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nad-im::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;
  width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--c,{{ s.gold }})}

@media (min-width:900px){
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate{margin:22px {{ s.gutter_d }}px 0;
    width:calc(100% - {{ s.gutter_d | times: 2 }}px)}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate-in{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr))}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate s{font-size:8.5px}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-plate figcaption{font-size:8.5px}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-shot figcaption{font-size:8.5px;padding:8px 12px}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-drawn figcaption{font-size:8.5px;padding:8px 12px}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nad-im{width:60px;height:60px}
}
</style>
